    "heading": "Challenge Rating",
    "lineStart": 12955,
    "lineEnd": 12957
  },
  "section": "8.29",
  "rulesText": "Challenge Rating (CR) summarizes the threat a monster poses to a group of four player characters. Compare a monster's CR to the characters' level. If the CR is higher, the monster is likely a danger. If the CR is lower, the monster likely poses little threat. But circumstances and the number of player characters can significantly alter how threatening a monster is in actual play. \"Gameplay Toolbox\" (\"Combat Encounters\") provides guidance to the GM on using CR while planning potential combat encounters. See also \"Stat Block.\""
}
